---
import '../styles/global.css'
---
<section class="py-[68px]">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5">
        <div class="text-center" data-anim>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-red mb-3.5">How it works</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[38px] font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3.5">Guided. Fast. <em class="not-italic text-red">Done Right.</em></h2>
          <p class="max-w-[58ch] mx-auto mb-10 text-text-dim text-[16.5px]">A guided switch, not a do-it-yourself migration.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 [counter-reset:step]">
          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-5 sm:p-[24px_20px] relative before:[counter-increment:step] before:content-[counter(step,decimal-leading-zero)] before:text-[26px] before:font-black before:text-gold before:block before:mb-2" data-anim style="--d:0.00s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a13 13 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold mb-1.5">Book an intro call</h3>
            <p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-dim">Tell us how your firm runs today. We show you exactly where the hours are going.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-5 sm:p-[24px_20px] relative before:[counter-increment:step] before:content-[counter(step,decimal-leading-zero)] before:text-[26px] before:font-black before:text-gold before:block before:mb-2" data-anim style="--d:0.09s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5.5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5.5v13c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-13"/><path d="M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold mb-1.5">Data migrated in days</h3>
            <p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-dim">The Quivr team moves everything from your current system, in under a week.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-5 sm:p-[24px_20px] relative before:[counter-increment:step] before:content-[counter(step,decimal-leading-zero)] before:text-[26px] before:font-black before:text-gold before:block before:mb-2" data-anim style="--d:0.18s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 8h10M18 8h2M4 16h4M12 16h8"/><circle cx="16" cy="8" r="2"/><circle cx="10" cy="16" r="2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold mb-1.5">Workflows customized</h3>
            <p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-dim">Task templates and automations built around how your firm actually plans.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-5 sm:p-[24px_20px] relative before:[counter-increment:step] before:content-[counter(step,decimal-leading-zero)] before:text-[26px] before:font-black before:text-gold before:block before:mb-2" data-anim style="--d:0.27s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold mb-1.5">Hours back</h3>
            <p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-dim">Meeting prep in minutes. Admin off your plate. A CRM your whole team actually uses.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="text-center pb-2" data-anim>
      <a class="inline-block bg-red text-white font-extrabold rounded-lg px-8 py-3.75 text-base hover:bg-[#5C1010] transition-colors" href="#leadForm">Show Me the Hours I'd Get Back</a>
    </div>